@startuml classes-global
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
title Diagramme de classes (modèle métier + couches principales)

class User {
  +id: int
  +email: string
  +password: string <<stocké en clair (MVP)>>
  +nom: string
  +dateNaissance: string
  +imageProfil: string
  +role: string <<user | admin>>
  +createdAt: string
}

class Subscription {
  +id: int
  +userId: int
  +plan: string <<free|basic|pro>>
  +status: string <<pending|active|paused|cancelled|expired>>
  +startsAt: string
  +endsAt: string
}

class PredictionLog {
  +id: int
  +userId: int
  +createdAt: string
}

class Stock {
  +id: int
  +typeProduit: string
  +quantite: int
  +dateEntree: string
  +dateSortie: string
  +budget: real
  +zoneAgricole: string
  +description: string
}

class SupportTicket {
  +id: int
  +userId: int
  +subject: string
  +message: string
  +status: string <<open|...>>
}

class ChatbotFaq {
  +id: int
  +question: string
  +answer: string
  +tags: string
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Subscription : possède >
User "1" -- "0..*" PredictionLog : déclenche >
User "1" -- "0..*" SupportTicket : ouvre >
User "1" -- "0..*" Stock : gère > 'via écrans (pas de FK user dans stocks)

class AuthService <<service>> {
  +creerCompte()
  +seConnecter()
  +seDeconnecter()
  +obtenirUtilisateurActuel()
}

class DatabaseService <<service>> {
  +initDatabase()
  +createUser() / loginUser()
  +getAllUsers() / setUserRole() / deleteUser()
  +getSubscriptions() / upsertSubscription()
  +recordPrediction()
  +... stocks, tickets, faq ...
}

class SubscriptionService <<service>> {
  +getSubscriptionStatusForCurrentUser()
  +ensureActivationRequest()
}

AuthService ..> DatabaseService : utilise
SubscriptionService ..> DatabaseService
SubscriptionService ..> AuthService

class PredictionScreen <<React>> {
  +saisie formulaire
  +appel HTTP /predict
}

class GollasenseApi <<Flask>> {
  +POST /predict
  +GET /get-options
  +POST /generate-pdf
  +GET /health
}

PredictionScreen ..> GollasenseApi : JSON

note bottom of User
  Schéma aligné sur la table SQLite ``users``.
  Admin seed : admin@monappia.local
end note

@enduml
